# OPIc Expressions — Day52

## Today's Expressions

### 1. I seem to have lost ~.

~을 잃어버린 것 같아요.

> I seem to have lost my wallet.

지갑을 잃어버린 것 같아요.

---

### 2. Could you help me look for it?

그것을 찾는 데 도움을 주실 수 있나요?

---

### 3. The last time I saw it was ~.

마지막으로 그것을 본 때는 ~였어요.

> The last time I saw it was at the cafe.

마지막으로 본 곳은 카페였어요.

---

### 4. If you find it, please let me know.

찾으시면 알려주세요.

---

## Useful Combination

> I seem to have lost my phone.
> The last time I saw it was at the restaurant.
> Could you help me look for it?

---

